// 1-10: swing + power practice, merged. Soft floor, blue ports. Practice.
id l1-10
name 1-10 SLACK LINE
tagline swing in. charge out. soft floor.
bg city
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main capacitor anchor
mechanics current:1 plank:3 anchor:1 capacitor:1
new capacitor
portion 3 swing practice over a soft floor
portion 3 capacitor gate: plug and run
hardness 3
map
