text BLUE PORTS ARE ANCHORS. HOLD {jack} TO HANG.\n{left}/{right} PUMPS THE SWING. LET GO TO FLY.\nTHE FLOOR IS SOFT HERE. NO CURRENT. PRACTISE.
text A CAPACITOR CHARGES WHILE PLUGGED.\nUNPLUG IT: IT KEEPS THE GATE OPEN. FOR A WHILE.\nTHE GATE IS FAR. RUN.
entity {"type":"source","x": 35,"y": 22,"id": "s1b"}
